<This
    <CommandPaletteRow (row) - row
        entry = row.#item

────────────────────
for event on key-press

if chooser
    if event.key == Key.escape && returns-to-commands
        show-commands()
        event.cancel()
    else if event.key == Key.backspace && !query
        show-commands()
        event.cancel()

